# maitri core package list pacstrapped by the ISO.
# The ISO builder also reads this file when constructing the offline mirror.
#
# Everything here resolves from the official Arch repos except the packages
# served from the [maitri] channel (maitrios/maitri-pkgs):
#   aether asdcontrol cliamp dell-xps13-sidecar-amps herdr helium-browser-bin
#   hyprland-preview-share-picker hyprmon-bin localsend maitri-fish maitri-nvim
#   maitri-vicinae-extension mise-bin omacalc omacut omawrite sublime-text-4
#   tensaku tobi-try ttf-ia-writer ttf-jetbrains-mono-nerd-basic ttfx tzupdate
#   ufw-docker vi vicinae-bin visual-studio-code-bin warp-terminal-bin
#   xdg-terminal-exec yaru-icon-theme yay
# Adding a non-Arch package here means adding its PKGBUILD to maitri-pkgs first.

